    "$t": "上課了後"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b>作者：王馨珮</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（「基進會輾轉台語文讀寫班」第11期學員 ）</span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tsin huann-hí ē-tàng pò-tio̍h tsit kái ê tha̍k-siá pan, tsai-iánn Tâi-gí-bûn khak-si̍t ū jī, jî-tshiánn ū hē-thóng teh kà ta̍k-ke si̍k-sāi, hōo guá kám-kak tsin kám-tōng.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Guá sè-hàn-sî-á tiàm tshù-lāi mā sī kap sī-tuā-lâng kóng Tâi-gí, khai-sí tha̍k kok-hāu-á liáu-āu tō khah tsia̍p kóng Huâ-gí. Tshut-siā-huē í-āu, in-uī tsoh-sit ê khuân-kíng khah tiānn iōng Tâi-gí hām lâng tsih-tsiap, guá tsiah huat-hiān ka-tī ê bó-gí lîng-li̍k kìng-jiân tsham Huâ-gí tsha hiah-nī tsuē.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Siūnn-beh siōng tha̍k-siá pan, tû-liáu hi-bāng ē-tàng ka-kiông Tâi-gí thiann, kóng í-guā, mā siūnn-beh ha̍k-si̍p “guá tshiú siá guá kháu” ê lîng-li̍k, kā buē-tàng iōng Huâ-gí piáu-ta̍t ê pōo-hūn iōng Tâi-gí-bûn kì-lo̍k--lo̍h-lâi.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Thiann lāu-su tsū li̍k-sú hong-bīn khai-sí kài-siāu Tâi-gí-bûn ê khí-guân, liáu-kái Tâi-uân ê li̍k-sú kap Tâi-gí ê khùn-kíng, kìng-ka hōo guá khak-tīng ha̍k-si̍p bó-gí ê tiōng-iàu-sìng. Gún tsit tāi ê bó-gí lîng-li̍k í-king tsham sī-tuā-lâng m̄ tsai tsha guā-tsuē--khí--ah, nā-sī koh m̄ phah-piànn, tō tsiànn-káng pàng-tsuí-lâu--ah.&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>#心內話 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報325期，2021年4月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH